 "what": "Brief 05e: board bring-up of luna run 7 (runs/20261102-191434-23d3/t1_dimmer_counter) on the Nexys A7-100T, SRAM only, wall power, owner-approved 2026-11-02. Bring-up code = branch f2-bringup-path (PR #17).",
 "verdict": "Two board runs. (1) The agent's design and files as written: power_ok, discover, program_base, uart_tests (3/3 pass), program_ila pass; ila_captures FAIL: the agent-written hw_checks.py uses condition OR, which Vivado cannot fit on a split probe. (2) DIAGNOSTIC ONLY, a copy of the design under build/ with OR changed to AND (the agent's files were not edited): ila_captures PASS (counter==10 and brightness==90 both captured at trigger position 768), still_alive FAIL: the agent's RTL hard-wires .BUILD_STAMP(32'h0) in the fpga_shell instance, so the ILA bitstream reports build stamp 00000000, not 61041db5. Scratch register kept, status error counters all 0.",
 "harness_defects_fixed": [
  "uart_tests pytest had no PYTHONPATH for the design dir (ModuleNotFoundError: model)",
  "import/collection errors in bring-up routed to stage 2 as hardware failures; now stage 9",
  "ila.load_capture lost hw_probes of equal name (counter_reg_n_0_ twice) and did not read name[0:0] one-bit ranges",
  "bringup --keep-captures crashed after a failed step when captures/ did not exist",
  "ILA never-armed failures now carry the Vivado ERROR lines; classified to stage 9"
 ],
 "agent_defects_not_edited": [
  "hw_checks.py: condition OR with a single compare (Vivado 27-3239); two captures",
