  "tests/test_t1_dimmer_counter_hw.py: parses --hw-stamp but never compares it with the identity register"
 ],
 "harness_prompt_and_dry_check_added": [
  "hw_dry_check flags OR with <=1 compared probe, and a constant-zero BUILD_STAMP in rtl/*.sv",
  "stage-9 prompt says to use AND and to pass BUILD_STAMP through"
